00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.250
And today I have a very
special guest with me,

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.500
TikTok's heartthrob, Owen Han.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.030
- Hello.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:21.863
I'm Owen Han.

00:00:21.863 --> 00:00:25.530
